OL,5,G0030 Through the Night
OL,6,     FThe Argovia Philharmonic,
OL,7,     Fconducted by Rune Bergmann, play
OL,8,     FDvorak's view of America with The
OL,9,     FNew World Symphony.
OL,10,G0630 Breakfast
OL,11,     FMark Forrest presents Radio 3's
OL,12,     FBreakfast show. To get in touch,
OL,13,     Femail 3breakfast@bbc.co.uk.
OL,14,G0900 Sunday Morning
OL,15,     FSarah Walker with a glorious
OL,16,     Fplaylist of music to accompany
OL,17,     Fyour summery Sunday morning.
OL,18,G1100 BBC Proms 2026
OL,19,     FThe Academy of St Martin in the
OL,20,     FFields spotlights the French horn
OL,21,     Fand bassoon in concertos by Mozart
OL,22,     Fand Thea Musgrave.
