OL,5,G1330 Music Map
OL,6,     FSara Mohr-Pietsch maps a musical
OL,7,     Flandscape around Mozart's Clarinet
OL,8,     FQuintet, listening in deeply to
OL,9,     Ffind sonic connections across time
OL,10,     Fand space.
OL,11,G1500 The Colours in Sound, with
OL,12,G     Caroline Shaw
OL,13,     FGrammy-award winning composer
OL,14,     FCaroline Shaw takes us on a
OL,15,     Fjourney through orchestration -
OL,16,     Fthe colours in sound. In this
OL,17,     Fepisode, she explores how
OL,18,     Fcomposers use the idea of space.
OL,19,G1600 Jazz Record Requests
OL,20,     FAlyn Shipton presents jazz records
OL,21,     Fof all styles as requested by you.
